! Marwa.ascl
!
Marwa in E - Nadi (just intonation). Austere and vast; komal Re, shuddha Ga, tivra Ma, Dha, Ni. No Pa at all.
!
 6
!
 16/15
 5/4
 45/32
 5/3
 15/8
 2/1
!
! Scale degrees (the annotations that used to sit on the pitch lines):
!   re    111.73 cents
!   Ga    386.31 cents
!   Ma+   590.22 cents
!   Dha   884.36 cents
!   Ni   1088.27 cents
!   Sa'  1200.00 cents
!
! Matches Nadi's internal tuning exactly, so instruments in this tuning
! and Nadi's resonators lock together instead of beating.
